<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= pageTitle %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"> </head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1><%= pageTitle %></h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="/">Home</a> |
            <a href="/movies">View All Movies</a>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <main>
        <p>This is a simple web application to browse movie data from your MySQL database. </p>
        <p>You can explore movies, their cast, and crew members. </p>

        <h3>Research Questions Addressed: </h3>
        <p>Based on your Stage 1, you identified questions you'd like to ask. This application helps answer some of them, such as:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>"What are the cast members and their characters for a given movie?" (Answered on movie details page)</li>
            <li>"Who are the crew members and their roles for a specific film?" (Answered on movie details page)</li>
            </ul>
        <p>Click "View All Movies" to get started.</p>
    </main>
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Movie Database App</p>
    </footer>
